 Brock","Student","ELA 6-1","","8:17 AM","11/11/2026","Attended","","6th Grade","","","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","6xi1Bq"],["Kimberly White","Instructor","ELA 6-1","","8:17 AM","11/11/2026","Attended","","","","","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","7hUyJq"]],"tutorSurveys":[["Kimberly White","","5","5","5","5","","","11/12/2026 10:43:07 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","1f8c4361c5154d5e8323e7d1b6903297","7hUyJq",""],["Theresa Bahr","","4","5","4","5","Students were engaged during session. We did a kinesthetic word warm up, a discussion about expectations (both ways), what we were going to go over in our sessions, and an overview of the flow of the sessions. I ended with two short debates to get conversation going: Should phones be allowed in school and Is homework useful. Students fully participated in the debate.","This group is very comfortable with each other, and conversation flows easily between them. They seemed relaxed in the room.","11/12/2026 10:42:59 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","5b413e12a53548958e754f4b3d8b46e5","1kIs4Z",""],["Kimberly White","","5","5","5","5","","","11/12/2026 10:39:07 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","b14fa2a189c342b1bd7a196a6fe76ce6","7hUyJq",""],["Theresa Bahr","","2","3","3","3","Students followed instructions and answered questions, but only what was asked of them in very few words. Sometimes they didn't respond. Only one person answered a question without me asking them directly. I felt that the kinesthetic word warm up was somewhat successful with some of them. I saw some smiles.","Ambria and Leo will need to warm up to tutoring. Leo especially. He didn't come in with arms crossed today, but he kept his backpack on and had no facial expression.","11/12/2026 9:56:35 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","778382cbe6104cda8c8553b596c8f9d2","1kIs4Z",""],["Kimberly White","","5","5","5","5","","","11/12/2026 9:54:29 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","ca8f5597826148f3bbb7ba1b4cb9d955","7hUyJq",""],["Theresa Bahr","","5","5","4","5","Thomas Oeter was pulled out of the classroom for speech. Students had a kinesthetic word warm up, then we talked about expectations, what we were going to be working on in our sessions, and an overview of the session structure.","Touleen talked about how she has no friends and does everything alone again. I asked her which teacher she liked and trusted the most and she said Mrs. Flynn. I suggested she talk to her. I told Stacey Goddard and we are going to follow up.","11/12/2026 9:19:43 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","68f2f0aa76d1481aa8b5de4226cae699","1kIs4Z",""],["Theresa Bahr","","5","5","4","5","Students were engaged throughout. We had a kinesthetic word warm up, then we discussed mutual expectations. I gave an overview of what we were going to be working on and what a typical session would look like. We discussed exit tickets. We ended with the survey.","Touleen talked about how she has no friends again, and I asked her who her favorite teacher was, the one she trusted the most. She said Mrs. Flynn. I told her to talk to her about it. ","11/12/2026 9:07:33 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","39fb046b91814739b56f71c299f75493","1kIs4Z",""],["Kimberly White","","5","5","5","5","","","11/12/2026 9:01:45 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","fcb0eb34e3b04bddb2b99fcba56586c1","7hUyJq",""],["Theresa Bahr","","3","3","3","4","For a first meeting, it went well. Students were quiet, but willing to share some information. I found out what they like to do, their favorite sports teams, what they like in school, and how they feel about enrichment. Some students have concern that they won't get enough time to get work done without enrichment. One student, Imran, said that he is very busy after school and feels like it's hard to catch up, and they keep giving him more to do.","","11/11/2026 10:27:43 AM","Glen Meadow","Vernon Township","090bfffc673740309750d93197d36698","1kIs4Z",""],["Kimberly White","","5","5","5","5","","","11/11/2026 9:35:03 AM","Glen Meado